window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>There’s only so long you can hold back the tide....</b></p> <p>With the weight of a kingdom behind her, Elise is ready to go back to where it all began, but who will be waiting when she arrives?</p> <p>Old secrets come to light, as a horrible truth is finally revealed. Friendships shatter and strain, as each of the friends is called upon to make that final sacrifice.</p> <p>The players are ready. The stage is set.</p> <p>But who will be standing when the dust finally clears?</p> <p><b>Royal Factions:</b></p> <p></p> <ul> <li><i>The Price for Peace </i>- Book one</li> <li><i>The Cost for Surviving</i> - Book two</li> <li><i>The Punishment for Deception </i>- Book three</li> <li><i>Faking Perfection</i> - Book four</li> <li><i>The Most Cherished</i> - Book five</li> <li><i>The Strength to Endure</i> - Book six</li> </ul>"; 
